msgstr "Wii游戏把你的DualSense当作什么。"

#: port/frontend/shell/porpoise_rows.cpp:247
msgid "Remote and Nunchuk: Nunchuk on the left stick, L1 and L2. Remote: point at the TV, with motion. Held sideways: like an NES pad, tilt to steer. Two DualSenses (alpha): the second is the Nunchuk. GameCube controller: for Wii games that support one. Each other DualSense is another player's Wii Remote."
msgstr "遥控器和双截棍：双截棍在左摇杆、L1和L2。遥控器：指向电视握持，使用它的体感。横握：像NES手柄一样握持，倾斜转向。两个DualSense（Alpha）：第二个是双截棍。GameCube手柄：用于支持它的Wii游戏。其他每个DualSense都是另一位玩家自己的Wii遥控器。"

